-- walkgrid (2.0.9, M 16 Nov 2026 in the Ruins of Zul'Kunda, the arrow to
-- The Third Troll Legend 54 yards off behind a wall: "It's just sending me
-- through walls ... this is the place where the quest is mainly done. So
-- this needs to be right"): the ground of a place cell by cell, from the
-- same walking maps as the net above (a cell is 4.17 yards): open = per
-- cell two hex digits, the steps that can be walked from it (1 north, 2
-- south, 4 west, 8 east, 16 north-west, 32 north-east, 64 south-west, 128
-- south-east; a wall or a ledge between two cells closes the step; where the maps
-- have floors over one another, the ground level's), kind =
-- its ground (0 none, 1 plain, 2 road, 3 slope, 4 steep, 5 indoors, 6
-- water). Row i is the cells x0 + (i - 1) * cell north, from y0 westwards.
-- vilereef (2.0.9, M 16 Nov 2026 in northern Stranglethorn, the arrow to The
-- Drowned City's entrance going round by the roads, 1,600 yards: "it's a
-- straight line and there is just water, no mountains"): north-west
-- Stranglethorn's coast and the sea off it as well (the last grid), so the
-- arrow there goes the way the ground and water allow, swimming included.
